Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:14:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] adapt houji passthru code to pandora APIs; stub
 cnss_get_wlan_tsf_gpio

- hdd_validate_channel_and_bandwidth ccfs1, policy_mgr_incr_active_session flow-pool arg,
  policy_mgr_2_freq_same_mac_in_dbs(psoc), wlan_cfg_get_num_tx_desc pool arg,
  vdev_del_notify cb signature, dp_vdev_register_wifi3 return type, AST cache helper rename,
  generic RX buf SMMU lock helpers, Kbuild drops houji-only -include
- pld_pcie_get_tsf_gpio: shipping cnss2.ko does not export cnss_get_wlan_tsf_gpio
- .gitignore build artifacts
